No.

261
00:18:30,667 --> 00:18:33,200
Oh, no, no. Don't listen to him.

262
00:18:33,333 --> 00:18:35,700
Since last night,
he's difficult to talk to.

263
00:18:39,433 --> 00:18:42,033
I'll just talk to Andrew
about this, okay?

264
00:18:42,167 --> 00:18:44,200
- Okay.
- I'll be back.

265
00:18:51,167 --> 00:18:52,800
Are you mad at lme?

266
00:18:52,933 --> 00:18:53,967
Me?

267
00:18:54,100 --> 00:18:57,300
Mad at you? No! You're the best!

268
00:18:57,467 --> 00:19:00,800
You do everything right!
Why would I be mad at you?

269
00:19:00,933 --> 00:19:02,433
You're the best.

270
00:19:04,300 --> 00:19:06,533
- Never.
- Are you slure?

271
00:19:08,633 --> 00:19:09,900
Eat now.

272
00:19:21,067 --> 00:19:23,067
In Amoroso?

273
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:27,833
You know, Golda was my informant
for five years,

274
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:31,200
but we never had an operation
there.

275
00:19:31,333 --> 00:19:35,933
And I know she has no relatives
there, she has no connections.

276
00:19:36,067 --> 00:19:37,700
She's not just an informant.

277
00:19:37,833 --> 00:19:41,667
She's also a criminal
and a drug dealer.

278
00:19:43,433 --> 00:19:47,800
Do you know who they call
the Godfather?

279
00:19:47,933 --> 00:19:49,800
The Godfather?

280
00:19:49,933 --> 00:19:51,667
Vincent Alcala?

281
00:19:52,933 --> 00:19:58,800
My assistant told me he has
the largest supplies

282
00:19:58,933 --> 00:20:01,300
of ammunition in the government.

283
00:20:01,433 --> 00:20:03,400
Not just the government.

284
00:20:03,567 --> 00:20:08,900
Also, rebels, private armies,
and terrorists.

285
00:20:09,033 --> 00:20:10,700
Why, Andrew?

286
00:20:10,833 --> 00:20:13,900
Is Golda there now?

287
00:20:14,033 --> 00:20:19,167
I'm not sure,
but there'sl a possibility.

288
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:21,367
Be careful.

289
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:23,667
That's a big syndicate.

290
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,900
And Joey...

291
00:20:26,033 --> 00:20:28,000
We know she's impulsive.

292
00:20:28,133 --> 00:20:30,100
She will not give up.

293
00:20:30,233 --> 00:20:32,300
You take care of her first.

294
00:20:33,567 --> 00:20:36,000
Andrew, this guy won't respect
you.

295
00:20:53,767 --> 00:20:54,700
So, what's the plan?

296
00:20:54,833 --> 00:20:56,267
It seems like we have no choice

297
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:58,367
but to enter the villa
of that Godfather.

298
00:20:58,500 --> 00:21:00,967
We can't pull this mission off
if you're acting like this.

299
00:21:01,100 --> 00:21:03,033
Do you know the house
of Vicente Alcala?

300
00:21:03,167 --> 00:21:05,700
The events team sent me
for the party.

301
00:21:05,833 --> 00:21:09,233
I want to ask for help
from your husband.

302
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,133
I was just thinking,

303
00:21:11,267 --> 00:21:12,633
if you could help me
with something.

304
00:21:12,767 --> 00:21:14,267
Her husband is in jail.

305
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:19,000
His name is Miguel Delgado,
former Major Miguel Delgado.

306
00:21:19,133 --> 00:21:22,233
You know, there are people
who feel like superheroes.

307
00:21:22,367 --> 00:21:25,000
- Are you talking about me?
- Why would I talk about you?

308
00:21:25,133 --> 00:21:26,767
- Are you guys fighting?
- No!

309
00:21:26,900 --> 00:21:29,033
I think one more shot.
Andrew, join us!

310
00:21:29,167 --> 00:21:30,067
- Game?
- Game.

311
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,467
- Truth or Dare.
- Spin.

312
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:32,867
Your turn.

313
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,767
- Truth or Dare.
- Truth.
